## Article 13. Right to review and appeal of court decisions

```catala
declaration scope Article13AppealRights:
  input isCaseParticipant content YesNo
  input courtDecidedTheirRights content YesNo
  input firstInstanceDecisionContent YesNo
  input hasAppellateReview content YesNo
  output hasRightToAppeal content YesNo
  output hasRightToCassation content YesNo
  output cassationWithoutAppealAllowed content YesNo

scope Article13AppealRights:
  label appeal_participant definition hasRightToAppeal equals isCaseParticipant

  label appeal_nonparticipant exception no_appeal_nonparticipant
  definition hasRightToAppeal under condition
    isCaseParticipant = No and courtDecidedTheirRights = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_appeal_nonparticipant definition hasRightToAppeal equals isCaseParticipant

  label cassation_default definition hasRightToCassation equals No

  label cassation_allowed exception cassation_default
  definition hasRightToCassation under condition
    hasAppellateReview = Yes
    and (isCaseParticipant = Yes or courtDecidedTheirRights = Yes)
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_cassation_skip definition cassationWithoutAppealAllowed equals No
```

## Article 14. Binding nature of court decisions

```catala
declaration scope Article14BindingDecisions:
  input decisionEnteredIntoForce content YesNo
  output isBinding content YesNo
  output noncomplianceHasConsequences content YesNo
  output nonParticipantsCanStillAppeal content YesNo

scope Article14BindingDecisions:
  label binding_exception exception not_yet_binding
  definition isBinding under condition
    decisionEnteredIntoForce = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_yet_binding definition isBinding equals No

  label noncompliance definition noncomplianceHasConsequences equals Yes

  label can_appeal definition nonParticipantsCanStillAppeal equals Yes
```
